g driver keeps on a wet surface or in rain: the two-second rule lengthened by a second","source":"driver manuals (as proposed this iteration by NRS_484B_127_1)"},{"name":"p.following_headway_ice","unit":"s","value":6.0,"convention":"time headway a following driver keeps on an icy or snow-covered surface: the tripled following time driver manuals advise","source":"driver manuals (as proposed this iteration by NRS_484B_127_1)"}],"gaps":[],"gap_resolutions":[]}

